<title>SINGAPORE: AXA Sime Assurance renamed after Sime stake sale.</title>
<headline>AXA Sime Assurance renamed after Sime stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>AXA Sime Assurance Pte Ltd said on Monday it had changed its name to AXA Insurance Singapore Pte Ltd after AXA's purchase of Sime Singapore Ltd 's stake in AXA Sime Investment Holdings in March.</p>
<p>AXA said in a statement this made AXA Insurance Singapore a wholly-owned subsidiary of France's AXA group.</p>
<p>Sime Singapore agreed in March to sell its general and health insurance business to AXA for a cash consideration of Singapore $57 million.</p>
<p>AXA was the 50 percent joint partner in Sime Singapore's insurance business. -- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
